# Licence

**Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)** — <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/>

This applies to the whole repository: source code, pipeline, generated data,
and generated tiles.

## Why this licence and not a permissive one

The project is not free to relicense. Its map geometry comes from the ASOIAF GIS
shapefiles by cadaei, theMountainGoat and Tear, published under **CC BY-NC-SA
3.0**. That geometry is load-bearing — remove it and there is no map — and the
ShareAlike term requires adaptations to be distributed under the same or a
compatible licence. CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 is the designated compatible successor.

Everything derived from that geometry inherits the same terms, which includes
the gazetteer, the terrain grid, the synthesised elevation model, and both tile
sets. The source code is placed under the same licence rather than a permissive
one simply so the repository has one answer instead of two.

## What this means in practice

You may share and adapt this work, including modifying it, provided you:

- **give attribution** — see [NOTICE.md](NOTICE.md) for the full chain of credit
  that must travel with the map data;
- **do not use it commercially** — no ads, no paid access, no bundling into a
  commercial product or service;
- **share alike** — distribute your modifications under these same terms.

## What this licence does not cover

*A Song of Ice and Fire*, *A Game of Thrones*, *House of the Dragon*, *A Knight
of the Seven Kingdoms*, and the world, places, houses and history they describe
are the intellectual property of **George R. R. Martin** and his licensees. This
is an unofficial, non-commercial fan project and claims no rights over them.

Article text drawn from A Wiki of Ice and Fire, the A Song of Ice and Fire Wiki
and the Game of Thrones Wiki is licensed **CC BY-SA** by those wikis and their
contributors, and is attributed per-article in the application.

Third-party software dependencies keep their own licences; see
[NOTICE.md](NOTICE.md).
